        "Often more severe hypoglycemia",
        "Poor response to diazoxide in some cases"
      ]
    },
    {
      "diseaseId": "congenital-hyperinsulinism-due-to-kcnj11-mutation",
      "distinguishingFeatures": [
        "Mutations in KCNJ11 gene",
        "Similar clinical presentation but different genetic cause",
        "May require pancreatectomy if unresponsive to medical therapy"
      ]
    }
  ],
